      <activity id="862ae9db-b4ce-5324-b5b2-d5f750f94512" activityNameId="eae040ef-b691-5176-8d3a-62acade128dd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rolled steel, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rolled steel, at regional storage
The data are aggregated from 5 European steel plants.;
UUID: 0a28f083-19b6-3e03-afa5-453dd38eb4c2
This data set includes the materials and resources needed for melting steel and producing rolled steel profiles used in Switzerland. The rolled steel profiles are produced in Europe and Switzerland and transported to the regional Swiss storage. Water and electricity demand are modelled with average Europe data. Data were collected by questionnaires.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average processes for melting steel and producing rolled profiles.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 24267t
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0a28f083-19b6-3e03-afa5-453dd38eb4c2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
